# Kubernetes (K8s) kya hai? 
Kubernetes (K8s) ek Container Orchestration Tool hai jo containers ko automatically manage karta hai.
> Simple Example
Maan lo tumhari website Docker containers me chal rahi hai.
1 container frontend
1 container backend
1 container database
Agar:
Backend container crash ho jaye ❌
Traffic bahut badh jaye 📈
Naya version deploy karna ho 🔄

To ye sab manually karna mushkil hai.
Yahi kaam Kubernetes automatically karta hai.

> Kubernetes kyu use karte hain?
✅ Containers ko automatically start karta hai.
✅ Agar container crash ho jaye to dobara start karta hai.
✅ Traffic badhne par aur containers create kar deta hai (Auto Scaling).
✅ Traffic ko sab containers me equally distribute karta hai (Load Balancing).
✅ Application ko bina downtime ke update karta hai (Rolling Update).

> Real-Life Example
Socho tumhare paas ek restaurant hai.
Chef = Docker Container
Restaurant Manager = Kubernetes
Manager ka kaam:
Chef beemar ho gaya → naya chef bulao.
Customers zyada aa gaye → aur chefs bulao.
Customers kam ho gaye → extra chefs hata do.
Sab customers ko proper service mile.

Manager = Kubernetes

